Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:24.30,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“AI makes anything easy to
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:24.30,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}copy. Pick what finds you
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:24.30,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}PMF.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:01.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, especially right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:03.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,now, because of the AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:04.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,agents, even if you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:05.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,not open source
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.11,0:00:06.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,it's so easy to copy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:07.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,whatever you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:08.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,So, if that's the case
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:09.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,you just do the right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:11.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,thing for a company
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:13.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,if closed source is the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,most useful way for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.27,0:00:15.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,to find a PMF
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,then just go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:17.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you're not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can just do both of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.79,0:00:19.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,them. that I could just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:21.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,do it, so I pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:22.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,aligned with the Hang's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,idea on it.
